    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Multiplayer Space Sandbox Experience</h2><br>Set out as a nameless pilot with an unremarkable ship and a handful of credits.  Earn influence and wealth by taking missions for various factions throughout the universe.  Obtain the respect or ire of law enforcement, become a feared bounty hunter, a daring smuggler, or a ruthless outlaw.  Every mission you take, every ship you destroy, every convoy you rob will affect your standing with numerous factions.  Use your earned credits to outfit your ship, hire a crew, and purchase larger, faster, or more powerful ships.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/6c714ef3ced28dbbe75b78acc3ff8ef8.poster.avif?t=1667221432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/6c714ef3ced28dbbe75b78acc3ff8ef8.webm?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/6c714ef3ced28dbbe75b78acc3ff8ef8.mp4?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore an Open-World</h2>Traverse star systems using trade lanes, jump gates, and hidden worm holes solo or with a group of friends.  Discover profitable trade routes, find bustling planets, and lifeless moons.  Loot unique weapons and hardware by stumbling upon derelict ships in debris fields.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/9111fbf3e89832d44d930eb232a6f593.poster.avif?t=1667221432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/9111fbf3e89832d44d930eb232a6f593.webm?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/9111fbf3e89832d44d930eb232a6f593.mp4?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Multiplayer Space Sandbox Experience</h2><br>Set out as a nameless pilot with an unremarkable ship and a handful of credits.  Earn influence and wealth by taking missions for various factions throughout the universe.  Obtain the respect or ire of law enforcement, become a feared bounty hunter, a daring smuggler, or a ruthless outlaw.  Every mission you take, every ship you destroy, every convoy you rob will affect your standing with numerous factions.  Use your earned credits to outfit your ship, hire a crew, and purchase larger, faster, or more powerful ships.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/6c714ef3ced28dbbe75b78acc3ff8ef8.poster.avif?t=1667221432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/6c714ef3ced28dbbe75b78acc3ff8ef8.webm?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/6c714ef3ced28dbbe75b78acc3ff8ef8.mp4?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore an Open-World</h2>Traverse star systems using trade lanes, jump gates, and hidden worm holes solo or with a group of friends.  Discover profitable trade routes, find bustling planets, and lifeless moons.  Loot unique weapons and hardware by stumbling upon derelict ships in debris fields.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/9111fbf3e89832d44d930eb232a6f593.poster.avif?t=1667221432\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/9111fbf3e89832d44d930eb232a6f593.webm?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1629780/extras/9111fbf3e89832d44d930eb232a6f593.mp4?t=1667221432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>",
    "short_description": "In Solara: Starlight Horizon fight, explore, trade, smuggle contraband, mine, craft, and undertake missions to gain favor with various factions throughout the universe. Earn credits, upgrade your ship, purchase new spacecraft, and explore a sci fi sandbox solo or with a group of friends",
